                <pb facs="0419" n="337" xml:id="pg337"/>

                <head>Liberia:</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Note.</hi>—The following subjects should be read in
                    connection with the instructions given April 13, 1909, by the Secretary of State
                    to the commissioners appointed by the President to investigate Liberian
                    conditions, to be found at <ref target="frus:frus1910/pg_705">page 705 of the
                        1910 volume of Foreign Relations</ref>; also in connection with the report
                    of the commissioners, and that of the Secretary of State transmitting it to the
                    President, which are printed in Senate Document 457, Sixty-first Congress,
                    second session.</p>




